"播放器按水平方向均分为左、中、右三个区域，滑动以手势开始的位置为准。按钮和进度条使用各自的操作，不触发区域手势。" = "The player is divided into left, center, and right thirds. Swipes use the region where they begin. Buttons and the progress bar have separate controls.";

