"仅恢复显示与过滤偏好，保留弹幕、API 配置和当前视频的时间偏移。" = "Resets display and filters only. Keeps comments, services, and the current timing offset.";
"速度随视频倍速变化；字幕避让为底部预留空间。轨道满时自动减少显示，避免重叠。" = "Speed follows playback rate. Subtitle spacing reserves the bottom area. Excess comments are hidden to avoid overlap.";
"关键词用换行、逗号或分号分隔，不区分大小写，按包含关系屏蔽。重复过滤会隐藏 10 秒内相同文字的弹幕，不删除原始数据。" = "Separate words with lines, commas, or semicolons. Matching is case-insensitive. Duplicates within 10 seconds are hidden; source data is unchanged.";
"已按当前视频预填搜索词，可手动修改。选择作品后进入剧集列表。" = "The current title is filled in for you. Edit it if needed, then choose a result to view episodes.";
"选择与当前视频对应的剧集。加载成功后替换当前弹幕，失败时保留原有弹幕。" = "Choose the matching episode. Comments are replaced only after a successful load.";
