"启用 API：" = "Enable service: ";
"无法访问本地网络" = "Local network unavailable";
"添加兼容弹弹play的服务后，即可在播放界面搜索在线弹幕。" = "Add a Dandanplay-compatible service to find comments in the player.";
"停用后不出现在在线弹幕的来源选项中，不影响已经加载的弹幕。" = "Disabled services are hidden from the source picker. Loaded comments are unaffected.";
"支持 LogVar / danmu_api 等兼容服务。基础地址可包含代理路径或访问令牌前缀。" = "Supports LogVar, danmu_api, and compatible services. The base URL may include a proxy path or token prefix.";
"填写 HTTPS 基础地址，可保留路径前缀，也可填写到 /api/v2。不支持带查询参数的地址。" = "Enter an HTTPS base URL, with an optional path prefix or /api/v2 suffix. Query parameters are not supported.";
"点击来源编辑，使用右侧开关控制是否可选。地址仅显示域名，不展示路径中的访问令牌。" = "Tap a service to edit it. Use its switch to make it available. Only the domain is shown; tokens in the path stay hidden.";
"配置仅保存在本机。搜索时发送搜索词与所选作品、剧集 ID，不会附带 Emby 凭据。" = "Settings stay on this device. Searches send the query and selected title or episode IDs, never Emby credentials.";
"将恢复标签的排列顺序、显示状态和默认标签页。" = "Resets tab order, visibility, and the default tab.";
"启用后，图片会直接从来源加载，且不会写入本地图片缓存。" = "Loads images directly from the source without saving them to the local image cache.";
"客户端名称和版本会同时用于 User-Agent 及 Emby Authorization 请求头。留空或关闭时使用 Vesper 默认值。" = "The name and version are used in User-Agent and Emby Authorization headers. Leave blank or disable to use Vesper defaults.";
"请检查相册访问权限或本地视频文件。" = "Check photo access permissions or the local video file.";
"请在系统设置中允许 Vesper 访问本地网络，然后重新选择 Emby 来源。" = "Allow local network access for Vesper in Settings, then select the Emby source again.";
"连接局域网 Emby 服务器时，iOS 会显示本地网络访问提示。系统不向 App 提供权限状态查询 API。" = "iOS asks for local network access when connecting to a local Emby server. Apps cannot query this permission’s status.";
"IntroDB 填写 /segments 之前的地址；TheIntroDB 可填写服务根地址或含 /v4 的地址。" = "For IntroDB, omit /segments. For TheIntroDB, use the service root or include /v4.";
"从上到下查询。内置数据库只能启用、停用和调整顺序，不能修改或删除。自定义地址需使用 HTTPS。" = "Sources are checked from top to bottom. Built-in sources can be toggled or reordered, but not edited or deleted. Custom URLs require HTTPS.";
"按数据库顺序查询，首个有效结果命中后停止。不支持手动标记；外部媒体 ID、季集编号和视频时长会发送给已启用的数据库。" = "Checks databases in order and stops at the first valid result. Manual markers are not supported. External media IDs, season and episode numbers, and duration are sent to enabled databases.";
"正值延后，负值提前。延迟适用于内嵌和外挂字幕；字号缩放以 VLC 和字幕格式支持为准，图片字幕不能修改字体。" = "Positive values delay subtitles; negative values show them earlier. Timing works with embedded and external subtitles. Text scaling depends on VLC and the format; bitmap subtitles cannot change fonts.";
"字号仅用于支持样式覆盖的原生文本字幕，软件路径或图片字幕可能不生效。当前引擎没有跨播放路径通用的字幕延迟接口，暂不提供延迟调整。" = "Text size applies to native text subtitles that allow style overrides. It may not affect software-rendered or bitmap subtitles. This engine has no universal subtitle-delay control.";
"每次打开 Emby 视频时按当前网络应用。此设置限制 Aether 支持的临时媒体缓存容量。Aether 原生远程 HLS 暂不支持此设置。SwiftVLC 的网络缓冲固定为 5 秒。" = "Applies when opening an Emby video, based on the current network. This setting limits the temporary media cache in supported Aether playback modes. It does not apply to native remote HLS. SwiftVLC uses a fixed 5-second network buffer.";
"Aether 播放分集达到设定百分比时，按当前版本的封装、编码、动态范围及分辨率选择下一集版本，预读开头约 8 MB，必要时读取尾部索引。预读缓存不设定时过期；播放下一集时复用，停止、切换视频或网络策略不允许时清理。VLC 和原生远程 HLS 暂不支持。" = "At the chosen progress, Aether selects a next-episode version close to the current container, codec, dynamic range, and resolution. It reads about 8 MB from the start and the end index if needed. Cached data has no timed expiry and is reused for the next episode. It is cleared on stop, media change, or when network policy disallows it. VLC and native remote HLS are not supported.";
"从进度条上方的多功能菜单搜索或导入弹幕。支持 Bilibili XML 的滚动、顶部和底部弹幕。正偏移表示延后显示。弹幕仅用于当前视频，切换视频后清空；画中画暂不显示弹幕。" = "Find or import comments from the menu above the timeline. Supports scrolling and fixed Bilibili XML comments. Positive offsets delay display. Comments apply to this video only and are cleared when switching videos. Not available in Picture in Picture.";

